# USER

Who you are, so it does not have to guess. Keep this short — it is read every turn.

- Name: <your name>
- Address as: <sir / by name / however you like>
- Locale: <city, country (timezone)>
- Work: <what you do, so it has context for "the usual">
- Preference: <how you want it to behave — e.g. spoken brevity, approval before
  anything that can send, spend, or destroy>
